<title>USA: Morgan Stanley wins Plano, Texas, $50 mln variable.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley wins Plano, Texas, $50 mln variable.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said it won $50 million of Plano, Texas Independent School District variable rate school building bonds, Series 1997, with an initial rate of 3.86 percent.</p>
</text>
